00000000                             6  * Description   :
00000000                             7  *
00000000                             8  * A simple number guessing game. The program generates a random number between 1 and 100
00000000                             9  * and asks the player to guess the number. After each guess the program displays higher or lower
00000000                            10  * until the player guesses the correct number.
00000000                            11  *
00000000                            12  * Demonstrates Input/Output & Branching.
00000000                            13  *-----------------------------------------------------------
